  "none Policies": "<section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto max-h-[52vh] w-[44rem] max-w-[calc(100vw-1rem)] overflow-auto p-2 text-xs" aria-label="Assign" data-testid="assign-panel"><div class="mb-2 flex gap-1" role="tablist"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Pawns</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold bg-accent-soft text-fg">Policies</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Tool rules</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Spare tools</button></div><div class="flex gap-3" data-testid="policy-editor"><ul class="w-36 shrink-0 space-y-0.5"><li><button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-muted hover:text-fg hover:bg-surface-2 h-7 px-2.5 text-xs gap-1.5 rounded-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg> New policy</button></li></ul><p class="text-muted">Pick a policy, or make a new one.</p></div></section>",
  "none Spare tools": "<section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto max-h-[52vh] w-[44rem] max-w-[calc(100vw-1rem)] overflow-auto p-2 text-xs" aria-label="Assign" data-testid="assign-panel"><div class="mb-2 flex gap-1" role="tablist"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Pawns</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Policies</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Tool rules</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold bg-accent-soft text-fg">Spare tools</button></div><div class="space-y-2" data-testid="tool-options"><label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg"><input class="size-4 rounded border-border accent-[var(--accent)]" type="checkbox" checked="">Craft a tool a job is waiting for (an auto bill “for tools” at the colony bench)</label><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span>Keep</span><input class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface px-3 text-sm text-fg placeholder:text-subtle transition-colors hover:border-border-strong focus:border-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--ring)] disabled:opacity-60 h-9 w-full h-7 w-16 text-xs" aria-label="Spare tools of each kind" min="0" max="8" type="number" value="0"><span>spare tools of each kind in storage (wood / stone first, iron when there are ingots)</span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg"><input class="size-4 rounded border-border accent-[var(--accent)]" type="checkbox">Pickaxe</label><label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg"><input class="size-4 rounded border-border accent-[var(--accent)]" type="checkbox">Axe</label><label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg"><input class="size-4 rounded border-border accent-[var(--accent)]" type="checkbox">Shovel</label><label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg"><input class="size-4 rounded border-border accent-[var(--accent)]" type="checkbox">Hoe</label><label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg"><input class="size-4 rounded border-border accent-[var(--accent)]" type="checkbox">Shears</label><label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg"><input class="size-4 rounded border-border accent-[var(--accent)]" type="checkbox">Sword</label></div></div></section>",
  "none Tool rules": "<section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto max-h-[52vh] w-[44rem] max-w-[calc(100vw-1rem)] overflow-auto p-2 text-xs" aria-label="Assign" data-testid="assign-panel"><div class="mb-2 flex gap-1" role="tablist"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Pawns</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Policies</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold bg-accent-soft text-fg">Tool rules</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2 hover:text-fg">Spare tools</button></div><div class="space-y-2" data-testid="material-rules"><p class="text-muted">Pawns always use at least the tool a material needs to drop (a stone pickaxe for iron ore). Raise it here, or mark a material to prefer an enchanted tool.</p><p class="text-subtle">No rules: every material uses its minimum tool.</p><ul class="space-y-1"></ul><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><select class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface px-3 text-sm text-fg placeholder:text-subtle transition-colors hover:border-border-strong focus:border-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--ring)] disabled:opacity-60 h-9 cursor-pointer appearance-none bg-[length:16px] bg-[right_0.5rem_center] bg-no-repeat pr-8 bg-[url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%23888' stroke-width='2'%3E%3Cpath d='m6 9 6 6 6-6'/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;)] h-7 w-56 text-xs" aria-label="Material to add a rule for" disabled=""><option value="">Add a rule for…</option></select><button type="button" disabled="" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-surface border border-border text-fg hover:bg-surface-2 hover:border-border-strong shadow-card h-7 px-2.5 text-xs gap-1.5 rounded-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg> Add</button></div></div></section>",
